    "name": "Ruins of Endoth",
    "steam_appid": 2963220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963220/extras/3dacfac0059ed6b6350428fadcf1cc55.avif?t=1746106259\" width=600 height=472 /></span><br><br><strong>Ruins of Endoth is a Third-Person ARPG set in a dark fantasy world with a focus on hack-and-slash, random loot and replayability.<br><br>Endoth is a broken world. A world ravaged by war over many centuries. A world where evil reigns and only pockets of survivors remain, huddled in the dark awaiting the arrival of a prophesised hero.<br><br>It combines classic ARPG elements such as stats, skills, swordplay, magic and levelling up with a mix of hand-crafted and procedurally generated maps to make every new game a fresh and exciting experience!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dark fantasy ARPG<br></li><li>Third-Person<br></li><li>Hand-crafted and procedural levels<br></li><li>Randomised loot<br></li><li>Randomised enemies<br></li><li>Mercenary contracts<br></li><li>Skills<br></li><li>Magic<br></li><li>Crafting</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963220/extras/3dacfac0059ed6b6350428fadcf1cc55.avif?t=1746106259\" width=600 height=472 /></span><br><br><strong>Ruins of Endoth is a Third-Person ARPG set in a dark fantasy world with a focus on hack-and-slash, random loot and replayability.<br><br>Endoth is a broken world. A world ravaged by war over many centuries. A world where evil reigns and only pockets of survivors remain, huddled in the dark awaiting the arrival of a prophesised hero.<br><br>It combines classic ARPG elements such as stats, skills, swordplay, magic and levelling up with a mix of hand-crafted and procedurally generated maps to make every new game a fresh and exciting experience!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dark fantasy ARPG<br></li><li>Third-Person<br></li><li>Hand-crafted and procedural levels<br></li><li>Randomised loot<br></li><li>Randomised enemies<br></li><li>Mercenary contracts<br></li><li>Skills<br></li><li>Magic<br></li><li>Crafting</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Third-Person ARPG set in a dark fantasy world. Fight enemies, collect random loot, level-up and explore the World of Endoth. Forge your destiny amongst it's heroes!",
